  "nativeFacts": [
    "RTTI type CX2BuffNeverMoveBehaviorTemplet has primary vtable330a46e4; apply slot+8=32accfe0, remove slot+14=32acd060",
    "32accfe0 reads actual target v124(1) XYZ when its existing apply latch is clear and calls321f22f0 with saved XYZ and member1c gravity",
    "321f22f0 creates CX2NeverMoveByBuff primary330248bc, writes10/14/18 XYZ,1c gravity and appends actor39a4",
    "32acd060 removes the matching identity through321f1630, which uses actor39a4/39a8",
    "31f70660..31f706c9 reads the final39a4 registration; gravity0 restores XYZ, nonzero restores XZ; velocities are not zeroed here",
    "The physics restore precedes remaining near-line/final SetPos; support reset31f5d110/31fbe000 erases the registration independently of the Buff timer"
  ],
